2026-10-13T21:15:18.4549128Z       ✓ Lab Manager can manage subordinate in own lab, but not in another lab (1 ms)
2026-10-13T21:15:18.4550399Z       ✓ Lab Manager cannot manage peer manager or project manager
2026-10-13T21:15:18.4551027Z       ✓ Lab Manager cannot elevate technician to manager role (1 ms)
