2026-10-13T21:15:18.4553618Z       ✓ resolveProjectLabs correctly identifies owner and servicing laboratories (2 ms)
2026-10-13T21:15:18.4554891Z       ✓ getDiscrepancyReport scans database and returns audit report without data loss (4 ms)
2026-10-13T21:15:18.4555788Z       ✓ canManageProject allows owner lab manager and super admin; denies non-owner manager
